    <defName>HE_Pars_BS_Merchant</defName>
    <title>road merchant</title>
    <titleShort>merchant</titleShort>
    <description>[PAWN_nameDef] led camel caravans along the royal road with silk going one way and silver the other, and haggled in every language spoken between the two ends.</description>
    <slot>Adulthood</slot>
    <spawnCategories>
